B.a.h(n,A.b("what it is"))
B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"The demo that the project shows is a terminal application: the heaplens-alloc example checkout_service_tui, built with ratatui and crossterm. Its allocation sites live in the same shared helpers as the console and GUI targets (support/checkout_common.rs), but they run inside a terminal UI loop. This test makes the identical claim as cross_process_wire_gui.rs, that a leak star (the pool manager with about 12 connections) and a hot star (the queue owner with up to 40 orders) both appear in the ownership graph built from the pipe. Everything about the harness is shared with that page, so this one concentrates on what differs and on what the copy left behind."))
n.push(B.b)
