B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"What did get wider is the ceiling on awaiting the graph task: 65 seconds, against the GUI test\u2019s 45. That ceiling never matters in a healthy run, since the graph task ends itself at its 38-second deadline; it only bounds a hang. So the comment\u2019s concern (a slow console delaying the T+30 and T+33 growth past the sampling window) is not addressed by the change that was made."))
