B.a.h(n,A.b("what question it answers"))
B.a.h(n,A.a(q,'The Attach button lets a user inject heaplens_hook.dll into a running program. The program will sooner or later exit while the DLL is still hooked in, because the user closed it, or it crashed, or the daemon was not there to ask for a detach. The daemon does not help: this file\u2019s last paragraph states that main.rs\u2019s TargetDisconnected handling "does not call injector::detach when a target exits on its own \u2014 it only clears attached_pid and broadcasts TargetExited". So "exit without detach" is not a corner case; it is the normal way an attached program ends. These four tests are what, in the file\u2019s words, "stand behind re-enabling the \u2018Attach to Process\u2019 UI gate".'))
