B.a.h(n,A.b("what the tests do not prove"))
B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"\xb7 That the hook was active during the workload. The tests check that the injector reported success, not that any event was captured, and no pipe server is running. The target waits 500 ms after printing its pid before starting work, and the attach has to finish inside that window for the workload to run hooked. If attach is slower, a test can pass without having exercised the hook."))
B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"\xb7 Rate. A hang that appears in 40 to 60 percent of runs is caught on a single run about half the time before the fix, and a regression that appears 5 percent of the time would pass most runs. These are single-shot tests."))
B.a.h(n,A.a(q,'\xb7 Different Windows versions. The FLS and DLL-unmap ordering the second finding worries about is described as "informal, not guaranteed"; one machine\u2019s clean runs do not settle it.'))
B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"\xb7 Only exit paths with a normal process exit (main returning or std::process::exit). A target killed from outside is not tested."))
