B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"The first version of classify had four statuses and was right for the cases its author imagined. It took a live run against a real target to find the fifth. Note what the fix did not do: it kept every original test passing and added rows, rather than rewriting the table. That is why the file reads as a layered record: the first five tests are the design, the next three are the correction, and the rest are guards on its edges."))
