B.a.h(n,A.a(q,'A second acceptance test handles a workspace dependency with cargo disabled (exec stubbed to fail): the member manifest becomes serde = { workspace = true, features = ["derive"] } # c with the comment intact, and the workspace root is asserted byte-for-byte unchanged.'))
