B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"The bacon_ls restart after apply is only checked as absent (no client). The positive path needs a real or fake bacon_ls client and is not in this file."))
B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"The lock\u2019s five-second stale rule is not tested; only the happy path under contention is."))
