B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"That last pair is worth a second look. The notes call them the clippy tier and the error tier and do not define the second one. And 0.71 s is slightly worse than the 0.56 s median from the micro-benchmark, with no explanation given. A reasonable reading is that the full stack adds the editor\u2019s own handling on top of the server\u2019s time, but that is a guess."))
B.a.h(n,A.b("every number in one place"))
B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"The measurements are scattered across comments, commit messages and two CHANGELOG entries. Collected, with where each one is recorded (CL is CHANGELOG):"))
