B.a.h(n,A.a(q,"One JSON-LD block, which is not an executable script and so passes the policy, says the same things for machines. A TechArticle with the headline, description, address and image, a breadcrumb of two items (the site, then this guide) whose last item is the page\u2019s own canonical address, and a Person for the author, linked by identifier. The spec checks that the data is valid JSON with absolute URLs, no ratings, reviews or prices, and that every inner page has a breadcrumb that ends at its own canonical URL. The headline in the data differs a little from the title tag (dependencies against crates); each is written for its place."))
