n.push(B.b)
B.a.h(n,A.c(q,"cf2b8e1 (2026-10-13)",'the only commit that touched the file. It arrived with scripts/test.sh, runner.lua and the helpers in the "Test infrastructure" commit, and has not needed a change since: the later work (Windows and macOS, sandbox fail-closed) went into helpers.lua and runner.lua.'))
